NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000188 "modify it under the same terms as Perl itself."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000189 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000190 "See F<http://www.perl.com/perl/misc/Artistic.html>"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000191 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000192 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000193 "=head1 AUTHOR"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000194 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000195 "Michael G Schwern <schwern@pobox.com>"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000196 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000197 "Now maintained by Neil Bowers (NEILB)."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000198 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000199 "=head1 SEE ALSO"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000200 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000201 "L<Module::Load> provides functions for loading code,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000202 "and importing functions."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000203 "It's actively maintained."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000204 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000205 "L<Module::Runtime> provides a number of usesful functions"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000206 "for require'ing and use'ing modules,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000207 "and associated operations."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000208 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000209 "L<Mojo::Loader> is a class loader and plugin framework."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000210 "L<Module::Loader> is a stand-alone module that was inspired"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000211 "by C<Mojo::Loader>."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000212 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000213 "There are many other modules that may be of interest on CPAN."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000214 "An old review of some of them can be read at"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000215 "L<https://neilb.org/reviews/module-loading.html>."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000216 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000217 "L<perlfunc/require>."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000218 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000219 "=cut"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000220 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000221 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000222 "1;"
BODY_END
